    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/be5738bcf276cf7155e706fa11d305ee.poster.avif?t=1754684867\" width=426 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/be5738bcf276cf7155e706fa11d305ee.webm?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/be5738bcf276cf7155e706fa11d305ee.mp4?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abducted. Experimented on. Now it\u2019s payback time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a rebellious young cowboy who\u2019s been snatched from Earth and thrown into a labyrinthine alien ship crawling with malfunctioning androids. After surviving bizarre experiments, you awaken with a biomechanical arm fused with an evolving alien artifact. It\u2019s unstable, unpredictable \u2014 and your only shot at escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Your Body</strong> \u2013 Unlock new powers as your alien artifact mutates your arm and legs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assimilate Weapons</strong> \u2013 Collect unique guns, but choose wisely: old ones are left behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Hell Meets Cowboy Fury</strong> \u2013 Dodge, dash, and blast your way through chaotic encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Handcrafted Levels</strong> \u2013 Each ending with a dramatic boss fight that reveals new lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brazilian-Style Survival</strong> \u2013 Outsmart aliens with the irreverent creativity of a true <i>gambiarra</i> expert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Filler, Just Fire</strong> \u2013 A focused 2\u20134 hour campaign packed with action and personality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/fd7adb84080dd3cf8fb32b4b5c188664.poster.avif?t=1754684867\" width=426 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/fd7adb84080dd3cf8fb32b4b5c188664.webm?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/fd7adb84080dd3cf8fb32b4b5c188664.mp4?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rustborn: Outland Threat</strong> is a short, explosive sci-fi action shooter where every decision matters. Fight through six handcrafted levels in a bullet-hell ballet of lasers, explosions, and alien steel. Assimilate weapons with unique effects \u2014 but choose wisely. Your arm only holds one of each type, and picking up something new means ditching the old. Regret is part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level ends with a twisted boss encounter that reveals more about your abductors \u2014 the decaying android race known as the <i>Rusts</i>. They\u2019re not the brightest circuits in the system, but they outnumber you. Badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only chance? Outrun, outgun, and outthink them with the one advantage they\u2019ll never have:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Brazilian attitude.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvise. Adapt. Make a mess. Blow it all up with <i>gambiarra</i>-grade brilliance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/0e079302bffcd611a72da0124b4c9a4f.poster.avif?t=1754684867\" width=426 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/0e079302bffcd611a72da0124b4c9a4f.webm?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/0e079302bffcd611a72da0124b4c9a4f.mp4?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/be5738bcf276cf7155e706fa11d305ee.poster.avif?t=1754684867\" width=426 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/be5738bcf276cf7155e706fa11d305ee.webm?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/be5738bcf276cf7155e706fa11d305ee.mp4?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abducted. Experimented on. Now it\u2019s payback time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a rebellious young cowboy who\u2019s been snatched from Earth and thrown into a labyrinthine alien ship crawling with malfunctioning androids. After surviving bizarre experiments, you awaken with a biomechanical arm fused with an evolving alien artifact. It\u2019s unstable, unpredictable \u2014 and your only shot at escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Your Body</strong> \u2013 Unlock new powers as your alien artifact mutates your arm and legs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assimilate Weapons</strong> \u2013 Collect unique guns, but choose wisely: old ones are left behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Hell Meets Cowboy Fury</strong> \u2013 Dodge, dash, and blast your way through chaotic encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Handcrafted Levels</strong> \u2013 Each ending with a dramatic boss fight that reveals new lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brazilian-Style Survival</strong> \u2013 Outsmart aliens with the irreverent creativity of a true <i>gambiarra</i> expert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Filler, Just Fire</strong> \u2013 A focused 2\u20134 hour campaign packed with action and personality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/fd7adb84080dd3cf8fb32b4b5c188664.poster.avif?t=1754684867\" width=426 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/fd7adb84080dd3cf8fb32b4b5c188664.webm?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/fd7adb84080dd3cf8fb32b4b5c188664.mp4?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rustborn: Outland Threat</strong> is a short, explosive sci-fi action shooter where every decision matters. Fight through six handcrafted levels in a bullet-hell ballet of lasers, explosions, and alien steel. Assimilate weapons with unique effects \u2014 but choose wisely. Your arm only holds one of each type, and picking up something new means ditching the old. Regret is part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level ends with a twisted boss encounter that reveals more about your abductors \u2014 the decaying android race known as the <i>Rusts</i>. They\u2019re not the brightest circuits in the system, but they outnumber you. Badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only chance? Outrun, outgun, and outthink them with the one advantage they\u2019ll never have:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Brazilian attitude.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvise. Adapt. Make a mess. Blow it all up with <i>gambiarra</i>-grade brilliance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/0e079302bffcd611a72da0124b4c9a4f.poster.avif?t=1754684867\" width=426 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/0e079302bffcd611a72da0124b4c9a4f.webm?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/0e079302bffcd611a72da0124b4c9a4f.mp4?t=1754684867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
